          "on": "is",
          "of": "doc",
          "text": "The Horizontal Pel Panning register is a read/write register at index hex 13, written at 03C0 and read at 03C1.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
